{"title":"Winter Wonderland","description":"\u003ch2\u003eCreate the Ultimate Winter Wonderland Look\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cem\u003eWinter Wonderland Décor Curated Collection\u003c\/em\u003e from King of Christmas transports you to a serene, snow-dusted wonderland. Our collection of flocked trees, frosty ornaments, and shimmering decor pieces help create a magical, wintry ambiance in any room. Whether you're dreaming of a white Christmas or just want to add a touch of cool elegance to your home, this collection has everything you need to transform your space into a winter paradise.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCurated Winter Wonderland Vibes\u003c\/strong\u003e Every item in our \u003cem\u003eWinter Wonderland Décor Handpicked Collection\u003c\/em\u003e has been chosen with care to reflect the crisp beauty of winter. Whether it’s a perfectly flocked tree with the look of freshly fallen snow or glittering glass ornaments that resemble frosty icicles, each piece contributes to a cohesive, wintry aesthetic. The soft whites, icy blues, and shimmering silvers in this collection create a timeless and elegant holiday display.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShop the Entire Winter Wonderland Look in One Place\u003c\/strong\u003e We’ve made it easy for you to achieve a cohesive winter wonderland theme by offering all the best decor in one collection. From trees to ornaments and all the snowy accents in between, you’ll find everything you need to create a magical holiday space without the need to search through endless options. Shop this collection and get ready to experience the joy of a wintry Christmas right in your own home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Setup, Lasting Magic\u003c\/strong\u003e Our artificial Christmas trees are designed for hassle-free setup and long-lasting use. Choose from pre-lit or unlit options, all crafted with quality materials that ensure your tree will look stunning year after year. Complement your tree with our curated selection of frosty decor to complete your Winter Wonderland theme effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"glass-snowflake-ornament-set","title":"Snowflake 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Blue) Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnhance your winter wonderland at home this holiday season, when you adorn your tree with our swanky snowflake inspired 15-piece hand blown ornament set. Designed with class and sophistication, in beautiful hues of blue. This delicate ornament set will surely make your holiday dreams come true. This snowflake themed glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":30092517900352,"sku":"KCX8H9Y","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SnowflakeOrnamentSet.png?v=1771875630"},{"product_id":"4-pack-snowflake-glass-ornament","title":"Snowflake Glass Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eGive your home a winter wonderland ambiance using our mouth-blown, Snowflake ornament. Hand-painted in a matte silver base, lightly accented with platinum glitter, this dainty glass piece will beautifully complement our snowflake ornament set or make for a great holiday gift for family and friends.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":31757328253005,"sku":"snowflake-4-pack","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SnowflakeGlass.png?v=1771875694"},{"product_id":"24-pack-white-essential-glass-ornament","title":"White Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThere’s just something about an all-white ornament theme that permeates an elegant holiday atmosphere. Give your centerpiece the royal treatment this season, when you adorn it with our 24-piece Essential White hand blown ornament set. Designed with the perfect combination of matte and metallic pieces, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319135408328,"sku":"OR24-WHTE","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/24PackWhiteEssential.jpg?v=1714663469"},{"product_id":"15-pack-blue-gray-glass-ornament","title":"Winter Wonderland 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Blue and Gray)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday tradition, you can’t go wrong with the classic and timeless blue and gray color theme. Bring your tree to life this season, when you adorn it with our 15-piece Winter Wonderland hand blown ornament set. Designed with elegant hues of blue and gray, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319135506632,"sku":"OR15-WW","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/WinterWonderland-BlueandGray15Pack.jpg?v=1722014545"},{"product_id":"netted-ribbon","title":"Netted Stretch Ribbon (10 yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour must-have décor is here. Whether you’re putting the finishing touches on your centerpiece, wrapping your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreaths, accessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick splash of Holiday elegance to that space that needs just a bit more, a little ribbon can go a long way. Our sparkling Netted Ribbon offers that final touch that will instantly complement any color theme in style. 10 yards in length, the decorating possibilities are truly endless. Upgrade your décor arsenal today with a roll of versatile Netted Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42345660481736,"sku":"RB-NETTED","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/NettedStretchRibbon_10yards.jpg?v=1714674628"},{"product_id":"15-pack-white-silver-glass-ornament","title":"Winter Frost 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (White-Silver)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the\n\u003cbr\u003eornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the\n\u003cbr\u003emost memorable moments of the season. That means\n\u003cbr\u003eyou can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each\n\u003cbr\u003eLimited Edition Winter Frost Glass Ornament Set is\n\u003cbr\u003ecarefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas tree and the memories that surround it.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith 15 distinctly designed pieces offering a unique\n\u003cbr\u003efrosty elegance of silver, gray and white; this refined set\n\u003cbr\u003egives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that\n\u003cbr\u003edemands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036302024,"sku":"MLK6K5N","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P10203892.png?v=1714674799"},{"product_id":"48-pack-white-shatterproof","title":"White Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each White Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a beautiful wintery blend of gloss and matte whites; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036400328,"sku":"QEB2T3M","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/WhiteShatterproofornaments.png?v=1785526273"},{"product_id":"48-pack-silver-shatterproof","title":"Silver Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each Silver Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a refined blend of gloss and matte silvers, this lovely set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends or little ones!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036531400,"sku":"WDE2Z3Z","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverShatterproofcopy_1.png?v=1722013751"},{"product_id":"12-pack-silver-accents","title":"Silver Accents Glass Ornament Set (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Silver Accents Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 12 distinctively designed pieces offering an elegant blend of stunning silvers; this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Gold Accents Ornament Set (12 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036826312,"sku":"VHM4B7C","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverAccentsGlassOrnamentSet_12Pack.png?v=1722013706"},{"product_id":"6-pack-silver-twists","title":"Silver Twists Glass Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Silver Twists Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 6 meticulously designed pieces offering an elegant “twist” of silvery holiday spirit, this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036859080,"sku":"GBW2U9C","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverTwistOrnamentSet.png?v=1722013768"},{"product_id":"6-pack-silver-frosted","title":"Silver Frosted Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Silver Frosted Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 6 distinctively designed pieces offering a gorgeous, frosty blend of silver and white, this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036990152,"sku":"FRP2S9R","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Final11.png?v=1714662353"},{"product_id":"8-pack-silver-dipped-pine","title":"Silver Dipped Pine Cones (8 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Silver Dipped Pine Cones Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 8 gorgeous pieces offering an elegant assortment of silver hues, this must-have set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037186760,"sku":"GAU8F2B","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverDippedPineCones1.png?v=1722013736"},{"product_id":"silver-ribbon","title":"Simple Silver Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eLooking for the ideal way to give your holiday\n\u003cbr\u003edecorations the traditional touch they deserve?\n\u003cbr\u003eLook no further than our Classic Silver Ribbon. With\n\u003cbr\u003estunning hue of shimmering silver, this ribbon is\n\u003cbr\u003eguaranteed to instantly elevate any holiday setting.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eClassic Silver Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037285064,"sku":"CEF6J8Q","price":39.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1020097copy.png?v=1714674766"},{"product_id":"silver-burst-picks","title":"Silver Burst Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eSometimes you don’t know you need something\n\u003cbr\u003euntil you see it, like an elegant set of Silver Burst\n\u003cbr\u003ePicks. With a sparkling beauty that will bring joy to\n\u003cbr\u003eyou and your guests for years to come, these picks\n\u003cbr\u003eare the holiday accent that can fit in virtually\n\u003cbr\u003eanywhere. Infuse your holiday decorations with a\n\u003cbr\u003esparkling burst of silvery holiday magic.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Silver Burst Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037579976,"sku":"EDS6Y5T","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverBurstPicks_12Pack.png?v=1722013727"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/90A0648.jpg?v=1760625338","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/winter-wonderland-decor.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}